(7410290, 1168033, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely evocation of a way to go, as put forth so poetically in the title.  Impressive in its accomplished suggestiveness, its rich understatement.  The clouds about the pier or trestle are softly modulated, gray to white, backed by the hinted blue of, I believe, sky and water.  I''ll term the two white patches, by the upper left edge, ideas of birds.  Honest, straightforward and hopeful.  An image of deep empathy and affection.<br/>Personal favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely evocation of a way to go, as put forth so poetically in the title.  Impressive in its accomplished suggestiveness, its rich understatement.  The clouds about the pier or trestle are softly modulated, gray to white, backed by the hinted blue of, I believe, sky and water.  I''ll term the two white patches, by the upper left edge, ideas of birds.  Honest, straightforward and hopeful.  An image of deep empathy and affection.Personal favorite in the challenge.', '2015-10-16 12:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7410291, 1167897, 173844, '<td valign="top">Bursting with glory.  A fanciful adumbration of enlightenment.  The stars look down on us, friendly in the night.  I see the quonset hut as a dark passage, but part of life, to enter and leave.  Great image.</td>', 'Bursting with glory.  A fanciful adumbration of enlightenment.  The stars look down on us, friendly in the night.  I see the quonset hut as a dark passage, but part of life, to enter and leave.  Great image.', '2015-10-16 12:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
