(7411012, 1167700, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, joyous, verging on psychedelic dance in the ocean, mother of us all.  Surprisingly light and airy.  I''ll blunder past your modesty and say it --- rays of light.  Truly a gift.</td>', 'A beautiful, joyous, verging on psychedelic dance in the ocean, mother of us all.  Surprisingly light and airy.  I''ll blunder past your modesty and say it --- rays of light.  Truly a gift.', '2015-10-20 10:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411026, 1167925, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fascinating, evocative, moving.  With regard to the title, the image is ambiguous and multi-leveled, no pun intended.  Fending off nightmares, but the hand is highly translucent.  Is it not possible or must we look at them if they are to be resolved and transcended.  The background shapes and textures handsomely set off the foreground image.</td>', 'Fascinating, evocative, moving.  With regard to the title, the image is ambiguous and multi-leveled, no pun intended.  Fending off nightmares, but the hand is highly translucent.  Is it not possible or must we look at them if they are to be resolved and transcended.  The background shapes and textures handsomely set off the foreground image.', '2015-10-20 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411028, 1167706, 173844, '<td valign="top">Mysteriously fanciful, suggestive of re-emergence.  Or a dream fading out of memory.  Both work.  Throw in a clock and you''re golden.  Superior work.</td>', 'Mysteriously fanciful, suggestive of re-emergence.  Or a dream fading out of memory.  Both work.  Throw in a clock and you''re golden.  Superior work.', '2015-10-20 11:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411033, 1167999, 173844, '<td valign="top">Took a while to start to understand how this is put together, and find it all the more admirable now that I have.  So very creative.  Sweetly wondrous and hopeful.  A real work of art.</td>', 'Took a while to start to understand how this is put together, and find it all the more admirable now that I have.  So very creative.  Sweetly wondrous and hopeful.  A real work of art.', '2015-10-20 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411037, 1167905, 173844, '<td valign="top">Airy, delicate, sun-drenched.  It''s as if longing has pulled outdoors indoors.  It''s also as if a house abandoned has been reborn, re-imagined into an exaltation.  Extravagantly fine.</td>', 'Airy, delicate, sun-drenched.  It''s as if longing has pulled outdoors indoors.  It''s also as if a house abandoned has been reborn, re-imagined into an exaltation.  Extravagantly fine.', '2015-10-20 12:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411039, 1167996, 173844, '<td valign="top">Moody, evocative sea/landscape that''s been beautifully twinned to partner with the charming title.  Very moving.  Powerful currents, dark abundance, blossoming skies.  Confident and artistic.</td>', 'Moody, evocative sea/landscape that''s been beautifully twinned to partner with the charming title.  Very moving.  Powerful currents, dark abundance, blossoming skies.  Confident and artistic.', '2015-10-20 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411041, 1167982, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully handled.  There''s a sense of personal commitment here both generous and sincere.  The tan tones enhance the repetitive pattern (over-redundant?) and help launch the surprise of the upraised face.  A graphic triumph.</td>', 'Beautifully handled.  There''s a sense of personal commitment here both generous and sincere.  The tan tones enhance the repetitive pattern (over-redundant?) and help launch the surprise of the upraised face.  A graphic triumph.', '2015-10-20 13:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411042, 1167991, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sweet, kind and forthright.  A beautiful double portrait.  Friends are a world of comfort, so generously proffered here.  Elegant textures, tones and lighting.  A tour de force of its genre.</td>', 'Sweet, kind and forthright.  A beautiful double portrait.  Friends are a world of comfort, so generously proffered here.  Elegant textures, tones and lighting.  A tour de force of its genre.', '2015-10-20 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411043, 1167911, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image of birds, plants, rock and their reflections.  Beautiful colors so delicately shaded (the banding is not obtrusive, I find).  Fine composition.  Heartfelt.  Very nice.</td>', 'Lovely image of birds, plants, rock and their reflections.  Beautiful colors so delicately shaded (the banding is not obtrusive, I find).  Fine composition.  Heartfelt.  Very nice.', '2015-10-20 13:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411044, 1168016, 173844, '<td valign="top">A glorious morning just inviting one to stride forth and embrace it.  The wide curvature adds a sense of intimacy.  The phantom halo at right center adds a touch of magic.  Very uplifting.</td>', 'A glorious morning just inviting one to stride forth and embrace it.  The wide curvature adds a sense of intimacy.  The phantom halo at right center adds a touch of magic.  Very uplifting.', '2015-10-20 13:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411046, 1167975, 173844, '<td valign="top">This could be counted plain, but it''s an understated marvel of everyday impressionism.  The horizontal bands of color and texture are soothing and quietly joyful.  I feel these bands to be welcoming arms.  So lovely.</td>', 'This could be counted plain, but it''s an understated marvel of everyday impressionism.  The horizontal bands of color and texture are soothing and quietly joyful.  I feel these bands to be welcoming arms.  So lovely.', '2015-10-20 13:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411047, 1167914, 173844, '<td valign="top">Serenity, just so.  The trees nicely frame, almost curtain, the scene featuring the geese.  This could be Tiffany glassware.</td>', 'Serenity, just so.  The trees nicely frame, almost curtain, the scene featuring the geese.  This could be Tiffany glassware.', '2015-10-20 13:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411048, 1167823, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, wondrous how this amazing flower appears atop the water.  Reminiscent of the lotus, cherished for growing out of the mud and blossoming into beauty.  Great choice.</td>', 'Yes, wondrous how this amazing flower appears atop the water.  Reminiscent of the lotus, cherished for growing out of the mud and blossoming into beauty.  Great choice.', '2015-10-20 13:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411050, 1168030, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsomely achieved image of the leisurely search.  The overlay adds to the quiet mystery of nonchalant expectation.  The graininess is in keeping with the locale.  I like the composition.</td>', 'Handsomely achieved image of the leisurely search.  The overlay adds to the quiet mystery of nonchalant expectation.  The graininess is in keeping with the locale.  I like the composition.', '2015-10-20 13:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
