(7411084, 1167999, 113156, '<td valign="top">Just love this photo, somehow happy, somehow triste but overall dramatic, excellent. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153615" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153615.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153615.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153615.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Just love this photo, somehow happy, somehow triste but overall dramatic, excellent. ', '2015-10-20 14:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411087, 1167878, 113156, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, makes me want to take it. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153616" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Beautiful, makes me want to take it. ', '2015-10-20 14:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411092, 1167836, 113156, '<td valign="top">Just right.</td>', 'Just right.', '2015-10-20 14:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411102, 1167764, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Lots of symbolism flying around here.  I like the tilt, the curvature and the composition.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Lots of symbolism flying around here.  I like the tilt, the curvature and the composition.', '2015-10-20 15:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411103, 1168002, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quirky and dreamlike.  This very alert bird will quickly find the exits through which the sun is streaming.  The tint works very well, particularly as it rubs against the stated blueness of the bird.  A fascinating, alluring photograph.</td>', 'Quirky and dreamlike.  This very alert bird will quickly find the exits through which the sun is streaming.  The tint works very well, particularly as it rubs against the stated blueness of the bird.  A fascinating, alluring photograph.', '2015-10-20 15:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411104, 1168027, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The purity of the colors, in all their tones, sings out a happy welcome, an invitation to leap into life and exult in the wonder of it.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The purity of the colors, in all their tones, sings out a happy welcome, an invitation to leap into life and exult in the wonder of it.', '2015-10-20 15:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411105, 1167836, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title, the more so for both not capitalizing the "c" and making it a sentence.  And fitting, for this is a tender grace note, a simple instant that conveys a world of charm and emotion.  The grain and focus allows the image to softly fade away from the focused eye.  I particularly love the whiskers.  Loosely composed as a natural triptych.  A benediction.</td>', 'Wonderful title, the more so for both not capitalizing the "c" and making it a sentence.  And fitting, for this is a tender grace note, a simple instant that conveys a world of charm and emotion.  The grain and focus allows the image to softly fade away from the focused eye.  I particularly love the whiskers.  Loosely composed as a natural triptych.  A benediction.', '2015-10-20 15:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411106, 1168013, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsomely composed architectural abstract.  The sunburst, even in black and white, is like the brilliance of a diamond.  There''s an adroit balance that''s not sundered by the sun which suffuses us all.</td>', 'Handsomely composed architectural abstract.  The sunburst, even in black and white, is like the brilliance of a diamond.  There''s an adroit balance that''s not sundered by the sun which suffuses us all.', '2015-10-20 15:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411108, 1167736, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting and successful transition from photography into graphic artistry.</td>', 'Interesting and successful transition from photography into graphic artistry.', '2015-10-20 15:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411109, 1168018, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fine message very creatively expressed.  I wouldn''t blink if I saw this hanging in a museum, it''s that well done.  The composition is terrific.  The yellow and blue are strikingly integrated into the image.  Great stuff.</td>', 'A fine message very creatively expressed.  I wouldn''t blink if I saw this hanging in a museum, it''s that well done.  The composition is terrific.  The yellow and blue are strikingly integrated into the image.  Great stuff.', '2015-10-20 16:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411110, 1167974, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  Nice use of negative space allowing the story line to unfold from the fan through to the furthest cloud.  My only quibble is with the extension of the water out of the frame ---  it looks more plastic than realistic, which I guess was not your intention.  Not that I''d be capable of coming close to accomplishing what is otherwise a fine, surrealistic image.</td>', 'Clever idea.  Nice use of negative space allowing the story line to unfold from the fan through to the furthest cloud.  My only quibble is with the extension of the water out of the frame ---  it looks more plastic than realistic, which I guess was not your intention.  Not that I''d be capable of coming close to accomplishing what is otherwise a fine, surrealistic image.', '2015-10-20 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411111, 1167919, 173844, '<td valign="top">A creative spirit can make art out of whatever''s at hand, as clearly demonstrated by this snippet of a lamp and its surrounding details.  The colors are sumptuous,especially the yellow-orange.  The grain plays a major part in the atmosphere of the image.  The tilt gives it fine diagonals and motion, transforming the lamp into a rocket blasting off.  Terrific title.</td>', 'A creative spirit can make art out of whatever''s at hand, as clearly demonstrated by this snippet of a lamp and its surrounding details.  The colors are sumptuous,especially the yellow-orange.  The grain plays a major part in the atmosphere of the image.  The tilt gives it fine diagonals and motion, transforming the lamp into a rocket blasting off.  Terrific title.', '2015-10-20 16:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411112, 1167863, 173844, '<td valign="top">Attractive and idiosyncratic work of art.  It makes me marvel at the range of imagination present on this site.  Kind of at a loss in expressing my response beyond saying that I like this very much.  More than a good wine, it''s a vintage to be treasured.</td>', 'Attractive and idiosyncratic work of art.  It makes me marvel at the range of imagination present on this site.  Kind of at a loss in expressing my response beyond saying that I like this very much.  More than a good wine, it''s a vintage to be treasured.', '2015-10-20 16:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411113, 1167957, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sci-fi phantasmagoria that beautifully articulates the sentiment of the title.  Great color harmony.  Very stylish.</td>', 'Sci-fi phantasmagoria that beautifully articulates the sentiment of the title.  Great color harmony.  Very stylish.', '2015-10-20 16:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411116, 1167761, 173844, '<td valign="top">Magical conglomeration of light and shadow, muted colors and sparkling highlights.  An alchemist''s atelier.  Deeply charming.</td>', 'Magical conglomeration of light and shadow, muted colors and sparkling highlights.  An alchemist''s atelier.  Deeply charming.', '2015-10-20 16:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411117, 1167963, 173844, '<td valign="top">Heartfelt articulation of prayer and good vibes.  I feel compelled to look at every person here.  The two men in the deepest water seem to bracket the image and the sense of holiness.</td>', 'Heartfelt articulation of prayer and good vibes.  I feel compelled to look at every person here.  The two men in the deepest water seem to bracket the image and the sense of holiness.', '2015-10-20 16:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411118, 1167768, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely blurred abstract that "heightens" the brilliant yet elegiac feeling of autumn.  The seasons turn, birth, demise, rebirth, and better to embrace the entirety than dwell on passing situations and emotions.  Terrific evocation.</td>', 'Lovely blurred abstract that "heightens" the brilliant yet elegiac feeling of autumn.  The seasons turn, birth, demise, rebirth, and better to embrace the entirety than dwell on passing situations and emotions.  Terrific evocation.', '2015-10-20 16:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411121, 1167664, 173844, '<td valign="top">Edgy, appealing image.  I like the blocks of light and dark, and the edge lighting on the musician.  The yellow tone works well.</td>', 'Edgy, appealing image.  I like the blocks of light and dark, and the edge lighting on the musician.  The yellow tone works well.', '2015-10-20 16:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411122, 1167862, 173844, '<td valign="top">A flamboyant confection.  Compelling in its quirkiness.  Cute and a bit scary at the same time, but scary in the sense of majestic unknown.</td>', 'A flamboyant confection.  Compelling in its quirkiness.  Cute and a bit scary at the same time, but scary in the sense of majestic unknown.', '2015-10-20 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411123, 1167961, 173844, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what bitterballen is, but it looks like tasty comfort food, and that goes a good way to happy satisfaction.</td>', 'Don''t know what bitterballen is, but it looks like tasty comfort food, and that goes a good way to happy satisfaction.', '2015-10-20 17:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411124, 1167917, 173844, '<td valign="top">Transitions aren''t always easy, this image seems to say; these are hands reaching out over a network of light.  Graphically interesting.</td>', 'Transitions aren''t always easy, this image seems to say; these are hands reaching out over a network of light.  Graphically interesting.', '2015-10-20 17:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
